WEBVTT

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:09.860
I am the white void. I am the cold steel. I am the just sword.

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:13.240
With blade in hand shall I reap the sins of this world

00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:17.120
and cleanse it in the fires of destruction.

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:23.370
I am Hakumen. The end has come!

00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:25.790
You sunnuva bitch!

00:02:20.030 --> 00:02:25.910
Rebel 2: The Azure Successor

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:28.540
What is the matter?

00:02:28.870 --> 00:02:31.710
Are ye not the most powerful amongst men,

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:33.880
Ragna the Bloodedge?

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:36.460
Shut your mouth...

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:39.090
The same as always.

00:02:42.430 --> 00:02:45.140
Next, that woman will appear.

00:02:48.520 --> 00:02:49.730
<i>Shit.</i>

00:02:49.730 --> 00:02:52.940
<i>My attacks aren't doing jack. What the hell's going on here?</i>

00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:57.150
Your paltry blows mean naught before my blade.

00:02:57.150 --> 00:03:01.820
I will terminate the fate that leads to calamity here and now.

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:09.080
O Dark One, return to the maelstrom of chaos!

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:14.630
An event disruption!

00:03:14.630 --> 00:03:15.670
Cursed Grimalkin!

00:03:18.630 --> 00:03:19.470
Dammit.

00:03:20.170 --> 00:03:21.970
Don't resist it.

00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:25.600
Be a good boy now and just come quietly, Hakumen.

00:03:27.970 --> 00:03:29.640
Do not interfere!

00:03:31.690 --> 00:03:34.400
He dispelled the event disruption?!

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:36.070
Aw crap.

00:03:40.150 --> 00:03:41.240
Hey, bonehead!

00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:42.990
Get outta there, pronto!

00:03:42.990 --> 00:03:45.370
You can't even touch this guy the way you are now!

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:46.830
Who the hell are you?!

00:03:46.830 --> 00:03:49.580
I don't recall inviting no one to have a chat in my head!

00:03:49.580 --> 00:03:52.670
Who cares?! Just scram already!

00:03:52.670 --> 00:03:55.000
The hell? That makes no sense.

00:04:05.180 --> 00:04:06.550
This is the end.

00:04:06.550 --> 00:04:07.140
Shit.

00:04:08.220 --> 00:04:09.470
Time to pull out all the stops.

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:18.730
Restriction 666 released.

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:21.900
Dimensional Interference Field Deployed!

00:04:22.860 --> 00:04:25.910
BlazBlue, activate!

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:33.870
Here I come!

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:35.920
You damn masked bastard!

00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:40.300
And so it has begun.

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:09.700
Not yet.

00:05:10.370 --> 00:05:13.080
I've seen the story unfold up to this point several times before.

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:17.370
The part beyond it, however...

00:05:20.170 --> 00:05:21.840
Such frightening sounds...

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:25.550
I <i>thought</i> I was getting closer,

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:28.680
but maybe I got lost somewhere along the way.

00:05:41.480 --> 00:05:43.570
I feel...

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:45.860
I feel like I've seen this place before.

00:05:58.040 --> 00:05:59.000
What the—

00:06:12.010 --> 00:06:14.850
I've seen this place before!

00:06:24.980 --> 00:06:29.860
Identifying subject... Identifying subject... Identifying subject...

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:49.550
Go on. Go on!

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:51.970
The story goes on.

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:07.570
Murakumo Unit, activating.

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:09.150
Verifying subject.

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:11.660
Identified as a sister unit.

00:07:12.410 --> 00:07:13.530
You.

00:07:14.030 --> 00:07:14.780
Identify yourself.

00:07:15.490 --> 00:07:20.370
I am Boundary Interface Prime Field Devices No. 12.

00:07:21.460 --> 00:07:23.500
Anti-Sankishin Core Unit.

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:27.050
Subject, I request an explanation.

00:07:27.590 --> 00:07:29.340
Unit description.

00:07:29.340 --> 00:07:33.430
Boundary Interface Prime Field Devices No. 13.

00:07:33.430 --> 00:07:36.390
Anti-Sankishin Core Unit, Nu.

00:07:38.770 --> 00:07:41.140
Subject, your existence is incongruous.

00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:43.350
Suggested course of action: immediate self-destruction.

00:07:43.350 --> 00:07:44.900
Suggestion rejected.

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:47.070
Continued existence will be given top priority.

00:07:47.070 --> 00:07:49.150
Searching for response...

00:07:49.150 --> 00:07:51.450
Contact with unauthorized identical unit.

00:07:51.450 --> 00:07:53.280
Operability of subject: confirmed.

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:56.240
Appropriate measure: elimination.

00:07:56.240 --> 00:07:58.910
Commencing immediate elimination of subject.

00:08:03.620 --> 00:08:04.830
Bolverk!

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:43.750
What?

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:48.340
What in the world am I doing?

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:51.630
What is this?

00:08:56.430 --> 00:08:58.470
Why am I fighting?

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:21.910
Continuing attack on subject.

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:27.670
How can she still move?

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:30.920
Why won't she stay down?

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:35.800
Stay away from me!

00:09:42.510 --> 00:09:46.100
Unit reconnecting. Deploying petals.

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:49.770
<i>Am I...</i>

00:09:50.360 --> 00:09:52.110
<i>...going to die?</i>

00:10:00.570 --> 00:10:02.280
Get over here!

00:10:03.080 --> 00:10:04.620
I'm coming, Brother!

00:10:20.180 --> 00:10:31.190
Perish.

00:10:45.870 --> 00:10:46.200
Huh?

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:50.620
Why?

00:10:51.290 --> 00:10:52.500
<i>Why?</i>

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:54.670
<i>Why does he seem so familiar?</i>

00:10:54.670 --> 00:10:57.130
Good question. Why, indeed?

00:10:57.130 --> 00:11:00.090
Why the hell are you even here?

00:11:04.260 --> 00:11:05.310
Ragna.

00:11:06.350 --> 00:11:08.060
It's you, Ragna! It's been so long!

00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:12.480
Let's see... Last time was in...

00:11:12.850 --> 00:11:15.110
Akitsu wasn't it?

00:11:15.690 --> 00:11:17.230
Hell if I know.

00:11:17.230 --> 00:11:20.030
Did you come to kill me again?

00:11:20.030 --> 00:11:21.780
Not to kill you.

00:11:21.780 --> 00:11:23.030
To dismantle you.

00:11:23.740 --> 00:11:26.660
You're the only one for me, Ragna!

00:11:27.700 --> 00:11:31.460
Apart from you, Ragna, I don't need anyone!

00:11:32.670 --> 00:11:35.170
The last time hurt, you know!

00:11:35.170 --> 00:11:37.340
You pierced me so suddenly!

00:11:39.300 --> 00:11:41.380
I thought I was gone for sure.

00:11:41.800 --> 00:11:42.970
Enough.

00:11:42.970 --> 00:11:46.470
Oh, but it felt so <i>good</i>. Didn't it, Ragna?

00:11:46.930 --> 00:11:50.310
Piercing and slashing my entire body.

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:55.400
Abusing me before I was even born, unable to resist, unable to even speak!

00:11:56.980 --> 00:11:57.860
Enough!

00:11:58.070 --> 00:11:59.480
You were smiling.

00:12:02.990 --> 00:12:05.950
But today's different.

00:12:05.950 --> 00:12:10.910
Take a look! My body is fully formed, and I can even talk to you!

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:14.830
Oh, but maybe you liked it better the way it was last time?

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:17.000
I said enough!

00:12:17.250 --> 00:12:20.880
Hearing you say these things makes me want to puke!

00:12:21.760 --> 00:12:22.510
Yes!

00:12:22.510 --> 00:12:25.640
Ragna, you and I really are the same!

00:12:26.340 --> 00:12:28.890
You live to destroy, right?

00:12:28.890 --> 00:12:31.480
Nu, yourself, the world...

00:12:32.140 --> 00:12:34.770
You just want to smash it all to smithereens!

00:12:35.850 --> 00:12:38.150
Let's destroy it all, Ragna.

00:12:38.150 --> 00:12:41.150
Then the two of us can be together forever.

00:12:42.820 --> 00:12:44.700
You won't be by yourself anymore.

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:46.910
No more feelings of loneliness.

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:51.160
The sweet murmurs are a thorn that find home inside your heart.

00:12:51.160 --> 00:12:55.210
The more you fight it, the deeper the thorn pierces your soul.

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:58.130
No escape has been prepared for you.

00:12:59.170 --> 00:13:02.210
You are adrift, caught in the crevices of time.

00:13:03.050 --> 00:13:07.640
And your ultimate destination is the never-changing ending.

00:13:09.050 --> 00:13:11.600
Come here, Ragna.

00:14:10.820 --> 00:14:12.700
I'll hold you close!

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:16.450
What the hell?

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:18.670
What the bloody hell is this?!

00:14:19.540 --> 00:14:20.830
Damn it...

00:14:20.830 --> 00:14:22.750
Damn it all!

00:14:33.640 --> 00:14:34.930
You piece of shit...

00:14:36.810 --> 00:14:38.020
I'm so happy.

00:14:38.480 --> 00:14:41.350
We're finally together, Ragna.

00:14:47.940 --> 00:14:50.530
The conclusion is always the same.

00:14:50.530 --> 00:14:53.200
A predictable tale that repeats itself time and again.

00:14:54.160 --> 00:14:57.830
A puppet show that goes on for eternity within a closed loop.

00:14:58.460 --> 00:15:00.370
It feels good...

00:15:00.370 --> 00:15:02.920
I feels so good.

00:15:02.920 --> 00:15:05.130
You and I as one...

00:15:05.920 --> 00:15:09.590
More... I want to meld together even more!

00:15:12.510 --> 00:15:14.180
You crazy bitch...

00:15:24.440 --> 00:15:27.440
Don't you feel amazing, Ragna?

00:15:27.440 --> 00:15:28.570
Then...

00:15:29.570 --> 00:15:32.610
Restriction 666 released.

00:15:33.200 --> 00:15:36.410
Dimensional interference field deployed.

00:15:40.540 --> 00:15:42.920
Murakumo Unit, activate.

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:45.670
Y-You're insane!

00:15:46.130 --> 00:15:47.170
Damn it!

00:15:47.170 --> 00:15:51.220
Restriction 666 released.

00:15:51.510 --> 00:15:55.390
Dimensional interference field deployed.

00:15:56.470 --> 00:15:58.810
BlazBlue, activate...

00:16:00.730 --> 00:16:03.140
You're not quite up for that yet.

00:16:03.900 --> 00:16:07.440
You will be in just a bit, though.

00:16:07.440 --> 00:16:09.900
You can rage to your hearts' content.

00:16:10.320 --> 00:16:12.530
I'll help you.

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:15.320
Come on, let's go.

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:27.210
And the two of you will become a beast that will destroy the world.

00:16:27.790 --> 00:16:28.630
All right.

00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:31.460
I'll do it.

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:34.630
This world disgusts me.

00:16:35.340 --> 00:16:37.050
I'll take it within my hands...

00:16:37.050 --> 00:16:39.010
...and destroy it.

00:16:53.240 --> 00:16:54.990
No!

00:16:58.070 --> 00:17:01.790
You can't go!

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:10.670
Oh, it's you Saya.

00:17:11.380 --> 00:17:13.510
How're you feeling today, Saya?

00:17:14.840 --> 00:17:18.430
What the heck? Did you get into a fight with Jin again?

00:17:20.640 --> 00:17:22.810
Huh? What was that?

00:17:23.430 --> 00:17:25.850
Sorry, I couldn't really hear you.

00:17:26.390 --> 00:17:28.480
I'm just so tired.

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:30.650
So sleepy.

00:17:30.980 --> 00:17:32.530
Don't give up.

00:17:32.780 --> 00:17:33.530
Huh?

00:17:36.280 --> 00:17:39.410
Don't give up!

00:18:02.560 --> 00:18:03.600
Impossible.

00:18:05.890 --> 00:18:07.600
Bingo!

00:18:35.170 --> 00:18:36.130
Why?

00:18:37.260 --> 00:18:38.300
All this...

00:18:39.260 --> 00:18:40.590
You dumb jerk...

00:18:40.590 --> 00:18:41.340
Dumwit.

00:18:41.340 --> 00:18:42.010
Nincompoop.

00:18:42.010 --> 00:18:42.720
Idiot.

00:18:42.720 --> 00:18:43.430
Twit.

00:18:43.430 --> 00:18:44.100
Fool.

00:18:45.010 --> 00:18:45.720
Ass.

00:18:45.720 --> 00:18:46.390
Clown.

00:18:46.390 --> 00:18:46.850
Buffoon.

00:18:46.850 --> 00:18:47.270
Blockhead!

00:18:47.270 --> 00:18:47.680
Nitwit!

00:18:47.680 --> 00:18:48.100
Cretin!

00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:48.480
Dumbass!

00:18:48.480 --> 00:18:48.810
Oaf!

00:18:48.810 --> 00:18:48.890
Turkey!

00:18:48.890 --> 00:18:49.230
Quit calling me names already!

00:18:49.230 --> 00:18:49.520
Moron!

00:18:49.520 --> 00:18:49.890
Dope!

00:18:49.890 --> 00:18:50.440
Birdbrain—

00:18:56.570 --> 00:18:59.570
Well, y'know... That was kinda, uh...

00:19:00.990 --> 00:19:02.700
Sorry. My bad.

00:19:03.450 --> 00:19:05.160
I don't really get it, but...

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:14.340
Whoa! Ow! Th-Th-That hurts, yo! Ouch!

00:19:17.800 --> 00:19:20.470
Oh my gosh! I-I'm so sorry!

00:19:20.470 --> 00:19:21.800
What should we do?!

00:19:21.800 --> 00:19:24.970
I know! I'll go find someone who can take care of your wounds!

00:19:25.220 --> 00:19:27.600
Please wait there for a minute!

00:19:29.430 --> 00:19:31.980
Wh-What's the deal with her?

00:19:33.310 --> 00:19:34.690
It has begun to move.

00:19:43.490 --> 00:19:47.240
Thank you for giving me this wonderful spectacle, Ragna.

00:19:48.450 --> 00:19:50.120
Hold on, Rabbit!

00:19:50.120 --> 00:19:51.960
Who the hell's she?!

00:19:51.960 --> 00:19:53.880
The new Eye.

00:19:53.880 --> 00:19:56.040
An "Eye"? The hell is that?

00:19:56.840 --> 00:19:58.590
The Azure Successor.

00:19:59.090 --> 00:20:00.840
The Calamity Trigger.

00:20:02.340 --> 00:20:04.970
Unlike the imitation that you have in your possession,

00:20:04.970 --> 00:20:07.260
she is the one who will inherit the <i>true</i> Azure.

00:20:08.260 --> 00:20:10.810
The time that has been in an eddy has begun to flow.

00:20:11.480 --> 00:20:16.020
Even I do not know where this droplet the world has let fall will drift.

00:20:17.980 --> 00:20:19.820
I can hardly wait to see.

00:20:19.820 --> 00:20:22.200
I have no frickin' clue what you're getting at.

00:20:22.700 --> 00:20:24.910
Explain it to me. In full.

00:20:28.330 --> 00:20:29.490
It's coming.

00:20:30.450 --> 00:20:31.660
H-Hey!

00:20:31.660 --> 00:20:33.580
Hold on, you stinkin' rabbit!

00:20:36.880 --> 00:20:39.880
My power's an imitation?

00:20:41.010 --> 00:20:42.670
Mr. Ragna!

00:20:45.890 --> 00:20:48.140
She sure does look like her.

00:20:49.350 --> 00:20:50.270
Saya...

00:22:28.570 --> 00:22:30.490
<i>The world has begun to move forward.</i>

00:22:32.240 --> 00:22:34.580
<i>That man concerns me, but I have more pressing matters.</i>

00:22:41.290 --> 00:22:43.460
Right now, this comes first.

00:22:43.710 --> 00:22:46.800
Now, come. I'll play with you.

00:22:48.220 --> 00:22:50.470
Nox Nyctores Gigant,

00:22:51.890 --> 00:22:53.350
Take-Mikazuchi!

00:23:01.310 --> 00:23:03.060
We're an anime now! Congratulations, Brother!

00:23:03.400 --> 00:23:05.730
We'll finally have an audience to witness our fight, Brother!

00:23:05.730 --> 00:23:06.440
Episode 3: The Observing—

00:23:06.440 --> 00:23:07.320
Oh, Brother! Brother!

00:23:07.320 --> 00:23:08.150
Jesus, Jin, shut the fuck up!

00:23:08.150 --> 00:23:10.450
Brother! Brother!
